{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Hey John, long time no talk. On Friday, I got great news - I'm finally in the study abroad program I applied for! Next month, I'm off to Ireland for a semester."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_28-047c8df36b7e58f8f19a99a3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:33:22.264789+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "047c8df36b7e58f8f19a99a3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "047c8df36b7e58f8f19a99a3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Congrats, Tim! That's amazing news. So, where are you going to stay?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_28-4960f860a6e9d9731efacaf9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:33:22.296311+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4960f860a6e9d9731efacaf9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4960f860a6e9d9731efacaf9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Thanks! I'm gonna stay in Galway, it's great for its arts and Irish music. This place has such a vibrant atmosphere."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_28-21b7fdc0b2421765740a5468", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:33:22.317560+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "21b7fdc0b2421765740a5468", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "21b7fdc0b2421765740a5468", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Awesome, Galway looks amazing! Is there anything in particular that you're keen to check out while you're there?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_28-e96ada122d43b617f7150844", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:33:22.334529+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e96ada122d43b617f7150844", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e96ada122d43b617f7150844", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Yep! I'm so excited to explore the nature - it looks amazing!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_28-adae1b5818497377637e4456", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:33:22.352381+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "adae1b5818497377637e4456", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "adae1b5818497377637e4456", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, great view! Have you visited any other places?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_28-5ed855d2ec1ba9cd8cab8e2c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:33:22.370082+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5ed855d2ec1ba9cd8cab8e2c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5ed855d2ec1ba9cd8cab8e2c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: I want to visit The Cliffs of Moher. It has amazing ocean views and awesome cliffs."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_28-0249fdf5f807a0acaee68ce9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:33:22.386592+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0249fdf5f807a0acaee68ce9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0249fdf5f807a0acaee68ce9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, that's awesome! I could stop by there after my season."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_28-a225af3710f24dadd69eaf3c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:33:22.402207+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a225af3710f24dadd69eaf3c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a225af3710f24dadd69eaf3c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Cool, let me know if you're around!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_28-aa50eabddbb6ab670c5a8c38", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:33:22.420556+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "aa50eabddbb6ab670c5a8c38", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "aa50eabddbb6ab670c5a8c38", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yep, I'll let you know. Oh, I held a benefit basketball game last week."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_28-a473a54b085641f53861783e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:33:22.434627+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a473a54b085641f53861783e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a473a54b085641f53861783e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Wow! How did the game go?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_28-be333e34d91bf6fc903b472c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:33:22.454545+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "be333e34d91bf6fc903b472c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "be333e34d91bf6fc903b472c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: The game turned out to be a total success! Lots of people showed up and had a great time, plus we were able to raise some money for charity."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_28-63e34aca4584748e98b1da38", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:33:22.474221+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "63e34aca4584748e98b1da38", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "63e34aca4584748e98b1da38", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Great job organizing the event. That's really making a difference!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_28-f872c1c946b02dbe8fdb14a7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:33:22.497384+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f872c1c946b02dbe8fdb14a7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f872c1c946b02dbe8fdb14a7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks! It's amazing how basketball brings people together and creates a positive impact!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_28-0d893ad9473e225e58bab54e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:33:22.517467+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0d893ad9473e225e58bab54e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0d893ad9473e225e58bab54e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: You rock! Keep it up!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_28-999d229c0f42217ca844a53a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:33:22.541135+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "999d229c0f42217ca844a53a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "999d229c0f42217ca844a53a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Tim! It's awesome to see how sports can unite people. By the way, what book are you currently reading?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_28-7499ad20e534786c8eda1ed9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:33:22.562256+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7499ad20e534786c8eda1ed9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7499ad20e534786c8eda1ed9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: I'm currently reading a fantasy novel called \"The Name of the Wind\" by Patrick Rothfuss. It's really good!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_28-50e24f4a457971e46cc1997f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:33:22.584429+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "50e24f4a457971e46cc1997f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "50e24f4a457971e46cc1997f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: \"The Name of the Wind\" sounds cool. I'll add it to my list. Thanks!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_28-2a13a7e2a062dff8fe0e2c0b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:33:22.604358+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2a13a7e2a062dff8fe0e2c0b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2a13a7e2a062dff8fe0e2c0b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: I hope you enjoy it! Let me know your thoughts."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_28-d20c2aa096cd8f96f426e903", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:33:22.624170+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d20c2aa096cd8f96f426e903", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d20c2aa096cd8f96f426e903", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Will do! Thanks for the recommendation!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_28-735b7f4992717db6f18a7edd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:33:22.644888+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "735b7f4992717db6f18a7edd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "735b7f4992717db6f18a7edd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: No problem. Talk to you soon!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_28-6d145451c05a78472e403d1b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:33:22.662543+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6d145451c05a78472e403d1b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6d145451c05a78472e403d1b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
